CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F431A1787617145
OL,3,CCyclist Josh Tarling to ride in place
OL,4,Cof brother, 19, who died during race
OL,6,FFinlay was riding for the NSN
OL,7,FDevelopment Team and taking part in
OL,8,Fthe eighth stage in the north of the
OL,9,Fcountry. Now his brother will take up
OL,10,Fhis position in his memory.
OL,12,FTime trial specialist Josh Tarling was
OL,13,Fconfirmed as part of the Netcompany-
OL,14,FIneos team for the Vuelta a Espana on
OL,15,FThursday (20 August), with his
OL,16,Fparents, Dawn and Michael, posting an
OL,17,Femotional tribute on Instagram.
OL,19,F"On Saturday, Joshua will be riding
OL,20,Fthe Vuelta," the social media message
OL,21,Fread.
OL,26,@{D@AOU|D@LO]
