PN,43104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F431A1787617145
OL,3,CCyclist Josh Tarling to ride in place
OL,4,Cof brother, 19, who died during race
OL,6,F"Finlay was so incredibly proud of his
OL,7,Fbig brother, and would be watching
OL,8,Fnose to the TV and shouting as he
OL,9,Fcompeted. So it is right that Josh
OL,10,Fhonours that love and pride by doing
OL,11,Fwhat Fin always loved watching him do."
OL,13,FThe Vuelta a Espana begins in Monaco
OL,14,Fon August 22 and finishes on September
OL,15,F13 in Granada. Netcompany-Ineos
OL,16,Fdirector of racing Geraint Thomas
OL,17,Fadded the team's backing for fellow
OL,18,FWelshman Josh.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
