OL,3,CCyclist Josh Tarling to ride in place
OL,4,Cof brother, 19, who died during race
OL,6,F"It goes without saying that, as a
OL,7,Fteam, we all fully support Josh in his
OL,8,Fdecision to take part in the race,"
OL,9,FThomas said on the team's website.
